<li>Parent or guardian must have a FACEBANK account. If the parent or guardian does not wish to open an account an exception must be requested through the BDF</li>
<li>In case the minor is under custody of a legal guardian, a court order appointing the guarding is required.</li>
<li>If the parent or the legal guardian wishes for the account to be managed by a third-party a letter authorizing that person must be presented.</li>
</ol>
<h4><span><strong>Note</strong></span></h4>
<p>Some conditions may apply. Please check the Minor Account Agreement available in Online Banking.</p>
